Gap 3: break (10 lines, do alongside Gap 2)

Cooperative break. Add break? that checks Esc (scancode 1) and clears it:

```c
HELPER void h_breakq(void) {
    uint8_t st; __asm__ volatile("inb $0x64, %0" : "=a"(st));
    if (st & 1) {
        uint8_t sc; __asm__ volatile("inb $0x60, %0" : "=a"(sc));
