The calculator's state

```
\ calc.frac — a calculator written in Frac, running on FracOS
\ Registers used by the whole program:
\   ax  → accumulator (the "ans" value)
\   ln  → current line length
\   cx  → cursor position
\   hp  → history index (0 = editing, 1..N = recalling)
\   ix  → loop index inside line editor

def clbuf  0x400000 ;       \ 128-byte current line buffer
def chist  0x401000 ;       \ 16 × 128-byte history
def hsize  128 ;
def hmax   16 ;

0 :ax
0 :ln
0 :cx
0 :hp
